      <h2 class="disp">Eastern and southern Africa carry over half of it.</h2>
    </div>
    <p class="hiv-sub">HIV is not evenly shared either. Sub-Saharan Africa carries the overwhelming majority of the global burden, while new infections are rising fastest in Eastern Europe, Central Asia, Latin America, and parts of the Asia-Pacific. Circles are scaled to estimated people living with HIV.</p>
